      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "As a seasoned traveler, I understand the importance of knowing the weight limits for your luggage. The Eurostar allows a maximum of 32kg for checked baggage, but if your suitcase is heavier, you might have to pay extra fees. It's always best to check the latest guidelines on the Eurostar website or contact their customer service directly. \n\nRegarding your arrival time at St Pancras, it's recommended to arrive at least 30 minutes before the departure time to comfortably navigate through security checks. This will give you enough time to avoid any potential delays and ensure a smooth start to your journey. \n\nRemember, always pack light and leave some room for those unexpected surprises that come with traveling. And don't forget to bring a map or a guidebook, just in case you encounter any tricky situations or need to find your way to the right train. Safe travels, and may your journey be as smooth as a well-trodden path through a peaceful forest!",
      "source": "target",
